world  seesaw

floor

post
  is a    box 8 by 20 by 24 cm
  on      floor

pivot
  is a    point
  at      30 cm up

seesaw
  is a      box 2 m by 24 by 3 cm, 2 kg
  raised    30 cm
  turns on  seesaw hinge, about y, at pivot
  swings    from -25° to 25°
  damping   0.01 N·m·s/rad

ball
  is a    sphere 5 cm radius, 100 g
  moves   freely
  on      seesaw, at seesaw's far end

weight
  is a    sphere 7 cm radius, 1 kg
  moves   freely
  at      seesaw's near end
  raised  1.43 m
